{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15303830","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15303830","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1530383001:1":{"text":"네. 전 보칼리스보다 훨씬 작은 마을 사람이에요.","source_cn":"嗯。我的家乡是一个偏远的小村镇，可比呼临城小多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF708C3A6C66D3E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1530383002:1":{"text":"작은 마을이지만 저희는 잘살고 있었어요. 솔직히 말하면, 전 평생 고향을 떠날 생각이 없었어요.","source_cn":"虽然那里很小，但我们过得也不错。说实话，我本来打算一辈...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x460FB270973AE759","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530383003:1":{"text":"그런데 그 벌레가 고향을 완전히 파괴해 버렸어요....","source_cn":"但那些虫子来了，把我的家乡毁了个干净。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B0677ED108A691","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530383004:1":{"text":"그래서 보칼리스 같은 대도시라면 몬스터들을 막을 수 있을 줄 알고 도망쳐 왔죠.","source_cn":"所以我就逃来了这，传说中的呼临城。估计只有这种大城邦，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC98E2F57734B130F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1530383005:1":{"text":"여기서 살길을 찾을 수 있으면 좋겠네요. 못 찾아도 상관은 없어요... 어차피 전 아무것도 가진 게 없으니까요.","source_cn":"希望能在这找到活路吧。找不到也没事……反正我已经什么都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A916B43074D667B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:维奥":{"text":"비오","source":"维奥","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":1}}